@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Digital Watch

state Initial [*]
state TimeSettings
state AlarmSettings
state LightSettings

[*] --> Initial : Start

Initial --> TimeSettings : View/Adjust Time
TimeSettings --> TimeSettings : Increase Hour
TimeSettings --> TimeSettings : Increase Minute
TimeSettings --> AlarmSettings : Switch to Alarm Settings
AlarmSettings --> AlarmSettings : Turn On/Off Alarm
AlarmSettings --> AlarmSettings : Set Alarm Time Matches Current Time
AlarmSettings --> TimeSettings : Switch to Time Settings
LightSettings --> LightOn : Press Button
LightOn --> LightOff : Release Button
LightOff --> LightSettings : Press Button

LightOff --> [*] : Stop Light Feature

@enduml
